FPS-1 Football Prediction System

Project Overview

FPS-1 is a Python-based football match prediction system designed to estimate the probabilities of three possible match outcomes:

- Home Win (1)
- Draw (X)
- Away Win (2)

Core Components

- Poisson statistical modelling
- Historical football match analysis
- Multi-league prediction
- Probability calibration
- Model performance evaluation
- Ablation testing

Project Objective

To develop, evaluate, and improve a statistically driven football prediction model using historical match data.

Source Files

The complete project source archive is available in "FPS-1-source.zip".

Disclaimer

Predictions are probabilistic estimates, not guaranteed match outcomes.
